{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し第６回目。\nあとマジでもう少しで終わるからねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、お粥とリゾット、どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お粥が好きです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、なんでそんなに写真写りいいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはいこまでもわかりません。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、れなりんの共通の話題って何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひみつだよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんといこまだけのひみつよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、みそラーメン以外で好きなものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんのご飯ととんこつラーメン!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、富士宮焼そば食べたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありませんの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、どの星に行ってみたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュピター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、受験生なので、応援してくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃがんばれっ！自分との戦いだからね。\n応援しています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、PV撮影で長崎きたとき、長崎どう感じた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空が広かったな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、沖縄来たときある？\n行ったことないから行きたい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、ネイガー好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田県のヒーローだからなっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、普段秋田弁出ちゃう？\nあんまり出ないよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、りなっちの『趣味とか好きなものなど』これだけは譲れないものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンガ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、どんな音楽聴く？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボカロとかロックとかとか\nQ、おいシャンの間奏のとき、何と言っているの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時と場合によります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、香水つけてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは何もつけておりません。\nまっちゅんに赤ちゃんの匂いだと言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、握手会行ったら、顔覚えてくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って覚えるよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、最近はまっている事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンガしかー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、エリンギ食べれる？\n好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/3084476/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きなキノコね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほいっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ\nへばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}